message: "If you use this repository or its methodology, please cite it as below."
title: "Point-in-time options information for forecasting next-30-minute realised variance (MDS650 capstone)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Guerrero"
    given-names: "Miguel"
date-released: "2026-08-18"
version: "2026.08"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mguerrero896/mds650-capstone-research"
keywords:
  - realized-variance
  - volatility-forecasting
  - options
  - point-in-time
  - preregistration
  - reproducible-research
abstract: >-
  A preregistered, hash-sealed study of whether point-in-time options-market
  information improves out-of-sample forecasts of 30-minute realized variance
  for large US equities, with one-read holdout governance, studentized
  day-clustered inference, and measured provider-availability semantics.
